\begin{theorem}\label{prop:MMat}
    The $2$-functor $\MMat\colon \VDbl\to \VDbl$ is familial.
\end{theorem}
\begin{proof}
    This follows from the construction of $\MMat$ as a polynomial 2-functor given above along with \cref{prop:poly-familial,dof-between-vdbl-is-internal-dof}.
