\begin{proposition}\label{defining-Inc}
    Let $\vdcat{D}$ be a unital virtual double category. 
    \begin{enumerate}
        \item For each object $D$ in $\vdcat{D}$, we have $\widetilde\lambda_{\hu_D}=\widetilde\rho_{\hu_D}$; 
        we call this multicell $\widetilde\mu_D$.
        \item For each object $D$ in $\vdcat{D}$, $(D,\hu_D,\widetilde\eta_D,\widetilde\mu_D)$ is a horizontal monad in $\vdcat{D}$; we call this horizontal monad $\Inc_\vdcat{D}(D)$. 
