\section{Cartan Geometric Interpretation of the Gauge Structure}
\label{app:cartan}

In this appendix we reformulate the block–homothetic gauge group of
Section \ref{section:2-First setup} within the standard framework of
conformal Cartan geometry.  Besides making contact with familiar
conventions in the literature, this embedding singles out the fixed
