The bound \cite[Theorem 4.1]{gorbunov2020unified} is obtained by (i) showing satisfaction, for all $k\in[N-1]$, of
 \begin{align}\label{eq:gorbu}
      E[\|x_{k+1}-x_\star\|]^2\leq \phi\|x_k-x_\star\|^2+\alpha^2D_1, \text{ where } \phi=(1-\mu\alpha)\ \text{\cite[Lemma C1]{gorbunov2020unified}},
