\begin{proof}
Let $\xi \colon U(B)\flat (X,*_{X}) \rightarrow (X,*_{X})$ be a coherent action in $(\Set_{*})^{\op}$ with associated split monomorphism in $\Set_*$ 
\begin{equation}\label{ideal_split_Set}
\begin{tikzcd}
