In $\textit{Section II}$ we will discuss the energy parameters appearing in Eq.\Ref{eq:1} in terms of our experimental results along with those reported in the extensive literature on Ising computers. We will then discuss the feasibility of using the same building block (Fig.\ref{fig:building_block}) in generative AI using p-bits to replace the continuous or multi-bit digital neurons commonly used in feedforward neural networks ($\textit{Section III}$).

