\title{Property Elicitation on Imprecise Probabilities\\[1ex]%
\large Working Paper\footnote{This work is to be presented as a poster at the 14th International Symposium on Imprecise Probabilities: Theories and Application (\href{https://isipta25.sipta.org/home}{ISIPTA 2025}) in Bielefeld, Germany.}}

