    \cmidrule(lr){2-3} \cmidrule(lr){4-5} \cmidrule(lr){6-7} \cmidrule(lr){8-9} \cmidrule(lr){10-11} \cmidrule(lr){12-13}
    & Full & RoI & Full & RoI & Full & RoI & Full & RoI & Full & RoI & Full & RoI \\
    \midrule
