		\begin{problem}\label{Pb2}Find a compact set $K\subset \C\setminus \D$ with connected complement, a continuous linear form $\mu$ on $C(K)$, and an open set $U$ in $\{\Re(z)\leq 0\}$ such that, for any $\varepsilon>0$, any integer $N\in \N$, any compact set $L\subset \D$, and any function $\vp\in A(K)$ such that $\mu(\vp)\notin U$, there exists a polynomial $P$ such that:
