    \centering
    \includegraphics[width=\linewidth]{Fig5.pdf}
    \caption{Campaign \#1 equivalent of Fig.~\ref{fig:lineshapes}. Dashed and dotted lines show Rabi- and Lorentz-type contributions to the empirical fit function given by Eq.~(\ref{eq:empirical_fit9}).}
