In addition, a malfunction of the high-precision current supply after 82 out of 106 resonance pairs of campaign \#1 required a reset.
Therefore, the complex amplitudes $\mathcal{A}^-_{1}$, $\mathcal{A}^+_{1}$, and $\mathcal{A}^+_{2}$ are extracted after offset corrections on $\nu_\pm^\text{c}$ with three distinct frequency averages referred to as \#1a, \#1b, and \#2 in Tab.~\ref{tab:CampaignAverages}.
