We begin with horizontal duplicate crushing, as characterized in Equation~\ref{horizontal deduplicates}. Since these duplicates are confined within each sub-matrix $B_i$ of $B'$, it suffices to illustrate the process at the sub-matrix level for uniform application across all $B_i$. The procedure, illustrated in Figure~\ref{fig:crush}(a), proceeds as follows:
