\]
We note that  $\Ext^2_A(M, \R(N))$ is a finitely generated $\R(I)$-module. So $W = \image(g)$ is also a finitely generated $\R(I)$-module. As $\ell(W_n)$ is finite for all $n \geq 1$ it follows that
