\subsection{Rank 8}  \label{sub:1FrobRank8}
There are $159330691$ Egyptian fractions of rank~$8$ (see~\cite{A002966}). Among them, exactly $16993752$ satisfy the divisibility condition (see~\cite{A374582}), corresponding to $5792401$ distinct values of the global $\FPdim$ between~$8$ and~$113423713055421844361000443$. 

