\subsection{Fusion rings} \label{FuRingsNC}

The exclusion of rank~$5$ in the following result is inspired by a MathOverflow response of Victor Ostrik~\cite{OsMO}, with additional insights provided by Noah Snyder. The next lemma is elementary.

