There are four MNSD integral Drinfeld rings up to rank $5$, contained in \S\ref{sub:UpToRank5}, namely the Grothendieck rings of $\Rep(G)$, with $G=C_1, \ C_3, \ C_5, \ C_7 \rtimes C_3$.

