There are $24$ integral $1$-Frobenius, non-perfect MNSD Drinfeld rings of rank~$11$ with $\FPdim \le 10^9$. Copy-pastable data can be found in the file \verb|MNSD1FrobRank11DataOnly.txt|, located in the \verb|Data/odd| directory of~\cite{CodeData}.

