   Considering all the possible values of $V_{n_1, n_2, n_3, n_4, n_5}(P; \ga)$, we see that $\frac{29}{14}$ is the minimum value of $V_{n_1, n_2, n_3, n_4, n_5}(P; \ga)$, and it occurs when 
